    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 2 — Storm Wardens</strong></p><p><strong>“Weather is only random if nobody is in charge.”</strong></p><p>Storm Wardens treat wind, flood, ashfall, and static like administrative problems. They know how to ride a storm front, ground a lightning field, and keep a faction moving when the world is trying to turn travel into a funeral.</p><p><em>You’ve stopped enduring storms and started assigning them paperwork.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Once per strategic turn, your faction can suppress, blunt, or redirect a weather-based hazard affecting a local route, hex, or operation.</li></ul><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"stormT2\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Weather Veto</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Strategic Turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Suppress, blunt, or redirect a weather-based hazard affecting a local route, hex, or operation.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
